<title>SPAIN: Spain had 1996 net outflow in direct investment.</title>
<headline>Spain had 1996 net outflow in direct investment.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain had a 1996 net outflow of direct investment of 1.40 billion ecu, Eurostat said on Friday.</p>
<p>A statement said in the year Spain had investment outflows of 33 percent higher than the year ago at 3.65 billion ecu, of which 1.35 billion was within the European Union.</p>
<p>Inflows totalled 5.05 billion ecu, up eight percent from the 1995 and of which 3.69 billion ecu were intra-EU.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
